{
  "question": "Why does the pendulum period show persistent scatter around the baseline mean (σ ≈ 0.0092 beats) with no systematic drift, despite 96 carefully controlled trials over 10 days? Is this scatter consistent with instrumental noise alone, or does it point to an uncontrolled environmental variable or measurement protocol issue?",
